<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: <li>questDescription->[intro]The [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name] will perform a customary visit with any Archon of his domain upon request. Invite him, satisfy his royal needs for [shuttleDelayTicks_duration], and all of you can ride the shuttle to the Imperial flotilla. You may then join the Imperial court, or escape to a new life among the stars.\n\nEarning the title of Archon means completing quests to earn [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] with [asker_faction_name]. It may take years to finally achieve the title of Archon.\n\nDuring his visit, you must keep his mood above [lodgersMoodThreshold_percent]. This means providing royal perquisites like a lavish bedroom.[threatsInfo]\n\nThe [asker_faction_leaderTitle] will bring four of his personal guards and place them under your command. You must house these guards, but the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] will not complain if they are killed or unhappy.\n\nYou must keep the visitors at [map_definite] and not send them anywhere else. If you fail this quest or migrate, you will have another chance at it later.</li>

    <li>intro(sameQuestsCount==0)->You have learned of a way to escape this planet!\n\n</li>

    <li>intro(sameQuestsCount>=1)->You have been given another chance at royal ascent.\n\n</li>

    <li>threatsInfo(allowViolentQuests==true,priority=1)->\n\nOthers will take the opportunity to try to kill the [asker_faction_leaderTitle], and will attack with great intensity. Be prepared to defend.</li>

    <li>threatsInfo-></li> -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[intro][asker_faction_name] hizbinin [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri, istendiği takdirde kendi topraklarındaki herhangi bir Arkon'a geleneksel bir ziyarette bulunur. Onu davet et, [shuttleDelayTicks_duration] boyunca soylu ihtiyaçlarını karşıla; sonra hepiniz mekiğe binip İmparatorluk filosuna gidebilirsiniz. Ardından İmparatorluk sarayına katılabilir ya da yıldızların arasında yeni bir hayata kaçabilirsiniz.\n\nArkon unvanını kazanmak, [asker_faction_name] nezdinde [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] kazanmak için görevleri tamamlamak demektir. Sonunda Arkon unvanına ulaşmak yıllar sürebilir.\n\nZiyareti boyunca onun ruh hâlini [lodgersMoodThreshold_percent] seviyesinin üstünde tutmalısın. Bu, şahane bir yatak odası gibi soylu ayrıcalıkları sağlamak anlamına gelir.[threatsInfo]\n\n[asker_faction_leaderTitle], kişisel muhafızlarından dördünü yanında getirip senin emrine verecek. Bu muhafızları barındırmalısın, ama ölmeleri ya da mutsuz olmaları [asker_faction_leaderTitle] için şikâyet sebebi olmaz.\n\nZiyaretçileri [map_definite] konumunda tutmalı, başka hiçbir yere göndermemelisin. Bu görevde başarısız olur ya da göç edersen daha sonra yeniden şansın olacak.</li>
    <li>intro(sameQuestsCount==0)->Bu gezegenden kaçmanın bir yolunu öğrendin!\n\n</li>
    <li>intro(sameQuestsCount>=1)->Soylu yükseliş için sana bir şans daha verildi.\n\n</li>
    <li>threatsInfo(allowViolentQuests==true,priority=1)->\n\nBaşkaları bu fırsatı [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri öldürmeye çalışmak için kullanacak ve büyük bir şiddetle saldıracak. Savunmaya hazır ol.</li>
    <li>threatsInfo-></li>
  </EndGame_RoyalAscent.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>

  <!-- EN: <li>questName(sameQuestsCount==0)->Royal Ascent</li>

    <li>questName(sameQuestsCount>=1)->Royal [titleEnd]</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Ascension</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Ascendance</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Visitor</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Guest</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Host</li>

    <li>titleEnd->Victory</li> -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName(sameQuestsCount==0)->Soylu Yükseliş</li>
    <li>questName(sameQuestsCount>=1)->Soylu [titleEnd]</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Yükseliş</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Yücelme</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Ziyaretçi</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Misafir</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Ev Sahibi</li>
    <li>titleEnd->Zafer</li>
  </EndGame_RoyalAscent.questNameRules.rulesStrings>

  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelFactionBecameHostile.slateRef>Görev başarısız: [resolvedQuestName]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelFactionBecameHostile.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: [faction_name] became hostile to you. -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextFactionBecameHostile.slateRef>[faction_name] sana düşman oldu.</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextFactionBecameHostile.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: asker.NoLongerFactionLeader -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.ReplaceLostLeaderReferences.inSignal.slateRef>asker.NoLongerFactionLeader</EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.ReplaceLostLeaderReferences.inSignal.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_leaderTitle] arrived -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelAskerArrived.value.slateRef>[asker_faction_leaderTitle] geldi</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelAskerArrived.value.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: The [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has arrived.\n\nProtect him and satisfy his royal needs until the shuttle arrives in [shuttleDelayTicks_duration].\n\nAll of you can accompany the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] on the shuttle and travel to the Imperial flotilla to begin a new life. -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextAskerArrived.value.slateRef>[asker_faction_name] hizbinin [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri geldi.\n\nMekik [shuttleDelayTicks_duration] içinde gelene kadar onu koru ve soylu ihtiyaçlarını karşıla.\n\nHepiniz mekikte [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lidere eşlik edip yeni bir hayata başlamak üzere İmparatorluk filosuna gidebilirsiniz.</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextAskerArrived.value.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Guest died: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestDied.slateRef>Misafir öldü: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestDied.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has died. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestDied.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite} öldü. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestDied.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Should depart on shuttle -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.InspectStringDepartShuttle.slateRef>Mekikle ayrılmalı</EndGame_RoyalAscent.InspectStringDepartShuttle.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Shuttle arrived -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleArrived.slateRef>Mekik geldi</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleArrived.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: The shuttle has arrived to collect the [asker_faction_leaderTitle].\n\nAll of you can accompany the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] on the shuttle and travel to the Imperial flotilla to begin a new life. -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleArrived.slateRef>Mekik, [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri almak için geldi.\n\nHepiniz mekikte [asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lidere eşlik edip yeni bir hayata başlamak üzere İmparatorluk filosuna gidebilirsiniz.</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleArrived.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: The high stellarch will now welcome you into the Imperial flotilla as an honored noble party.\n\nYou might stay in the Imperial court and jockey for political power. Perhaps you'll avoid the drama and focus on enjoying ultratech luxuries. Or, you might even buy a ship and set a course for your long-lost home.\n\nThe choice is up to you. -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.EndGameEndingText.slateRef>Yüce stellark şimdi sizi İmparatorluk filosuna saygın bir soylu heyeti olarak kabul edecek.\n\nİmparatorluk sarayında kalıp siyasi güç için entrikalara girişebilirsin. Belki de bu dramalardan uzak durup ultra teknolojinin lükslerinin tadını çıkarmaya odaklanırsın. Ya da bir gemi satın alıp çoktan kaybettiğin yuvana doğru rota bile çizebilirsin.\n\nSeçim senin.</EndGame_RoyalAscent.EndGameEndingText.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: You've escaped on the Imperial shuttle! -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.EndGameIntroText.slateRef>İmparatorluk mekiğiyle kaçtın!</EndGame_RoyalAscent.EndGameIntroText.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_bestRoyalTitle} unhappy -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelSubjectUnhappy.slateRef>{SUBJECT_bestRoyalTitle} mutsuz</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelSubjectUnhappy.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect and keep happy, has been below the minimum mood of [lodgersMoodThreshold] too long. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextSubjectUnhappy.slateRef>Korumak ve mutlu tutmakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite}, çok uzun süredir [lodgersMoodThreshold] olan asgari ruh hâlinin altında. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextSubjectUnhappy.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Guest captured: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestCaptured.slateRef>Misafir tutuklandı: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestCaptured.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has been arrested. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestCaptured.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite} tutuklandı. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestCaptured.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Unauthorized surgery: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelUnauthorizedSurgery.slateRef>İzinsiz ameliyat: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelUnauthorizedSurgery.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Unauthorized, violating surgery has been performed on {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextUnauthorizedSurgery.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite} üzerinde izinsiz, ihlal niteliğinde bir ameliyat yapıldı. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextUnauthorizedSurgery.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Xenogerm absorbed: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.lodgersXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>Ksenomaya emildi: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.lodgersXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has had {SUBJECT_possessive} xenogerm forcibly absorbed. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.lodgersXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite}, {SUBJECT_possessive} ksenomayasının zorla emilmesine maruz kaldı. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.root.nodes.lodgersXenogermAbsorbed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Guest lost: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestLost.slateRef>Misafir kaybedildi: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelGuestLost.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has left the assigned settlement. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestLost.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite} kendisine ayrılan yerleşimden ayrıldı. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextGuestLost.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Shuttle destroyed -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleDestroyed.slateRef>Mekik yok edildi</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleDestroyed.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: The shuttle sent to collect the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] has been destroyed. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleDestroyed.slateRef>[asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri almak için gönderilen mekik yok edildi. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleDestroyed.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Guest lost: {SUBJECT_definite} -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelLodgerRanWild.slateRef>Misafir kaybedildi: {SUBJECT_definite}</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelLodgerRanWild.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: {SUBJECT_definite}, who you were charged to protect, has run wild. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextLodgerRanWild.slateRef>Korumakla yükümlü olduğun {SUBJECT_definite} vahşileşti. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextLodgerRanWild.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleSentUnsatisfied.slateRef>Görev başarısız: [resolvedQuestName]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterLabelShuttleSentUnsatisfied.slateRef>

  <!-- EN: The shuttle sent to collect the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] has departed without [asker_objective]. [asker_pronoun] will now leave on foot. [failLetterEndingCommon] -->

  <EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleSentUnsatisfied.slateRef>[asker_faction_leaderTitle] unvanlı lideri almak için gönderilen mekik [asker_objective] almadan ayrıldı. [asker_pronoun] artık yürüyerek ayrılacak. [failLetterEndingCommon]</EndGame_RoyalAscent.LetterTextShuttleSentUnsatisfied.slateRef>

</LanguageData>